--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/memory/decision-log/dl-002-compile-typescript-before-running-tests.md
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+---
+id: dl-002-compile-typescript-before-running-tests
+type: decision-log
+title: "Compile TypeScript before running tests"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+The package is TypeScript-only while its tests run with Node's built-in test
+runner. Node cannot import TypeScript source directly.
+
+## Decision
+
+Use TypeScript as a development dependency and compile the library before
+running tests.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Tests exercise the emitted public JavaScript entry point with no runtime
+dependencies added to the library.
