+---
+id: task-001-implement-rfc-6901-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented and exported `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` from `src/index.ts`.
+It follows RFC 6901 token decoding and traversal rules, rejects malformed
+pointers and unresolvable paths, and is covered by deterministic tests for
+normal and error cases.
